   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Verbos irregulares",
    "@en": "Irregular verbs"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "Muchos verbos frecuentes tienen una forma propia en pasado y no añaden **-ed**: go → **went**, have → **had**, see → **saw**, buy → **bought**, eat → **ate**. Aprende cada pareja presente-pasado.",
     "@en": "Many frequent verbs have their own form in the past and do not add **-ed**: go → **went**, have → **had**, see → **saw**, buy → **bought**, eat → **ate**. Learn each couple present - past."
    },
    {
     "@es": "La forma irregular pasada también vale para todas las personas: **I went**, **she went**, **they went**.",
     "@en": "The past irregular form also applies to all people: **I went**, **she went**, **they went**."
    }
   ]
  },
