  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Did en preguntas",
    "@en": "Say in questions"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "En preguntas usamos **Did + sujeto + verbo base**: **Did you go?**, **Did she eat?**. Aunque la respuesta sea pasada, después de **did** no ponemos el verbo en pasado. La respuesta corta es **Yes, I did / No, I didn't**.",
     "@en": "In questions we use **Did + sujeto + verbo base**: **Did you go?**, **Did she eat?**. Even if the answer is passed, after **did** we do not put the verb in the past. The short answer is **Yes, I did / No, I didn't**."
    }
   ]
